`contribution/patches/magentic-ui-0.1.6.patch` modifies six Magentic-UI files:
`agents/web_surfer/_web_surfer.py`, `teams/orchestrator/_orchestrator.py`,
`teams/orchestrator/_prompts.py`, `tools/playwright/playwright_controller.py`,
`tools/playwright/page_script.js` and `backend/web/managers/connection.py`. The added
lines are this project's work; the context lines in the patch are Microsoft's code
under the MIT License.

`src/magentic_ui/` contains the complete Magentic-UI 0.1.6 package with the changes above
applied, redistributed under the MIT License; bundled front-end assets carry their own
licence files (`*.js.LICENSE.txt`).

